   {
    "id": "ws_intro",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     0,
     700
    ],
    "code": null,
    "label": null,
    "params": {
     "text": "## Smaller report web pages\n\nThree tables, four report pages (no theme, **Slate**, **Midnight**, **Studio**) with one body. Open a page — it starts on the **Web** preview — then **Save HTML…** and inspect it:\n\n- a live data bar is `<span class=\"fg-db\">` + one `<i>` track, not two tables in the cell\n- a plain (paper) table's cells say `border:1px solid #999999` instead of twelve declarations",
     "width": 460,
     "height": 220
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "ws_bars",
    "type": "flograph.viz.show_table",
    "pos": [
     700,
     0
    ],
    "code": null,
    "label": "Bars",
    "params": {
     "format_rules": "Revenue  format $,.0f\nUnits    bar blue\nChange   bar green\nChange   format +.0%\nMargin   bar purple only\nMargin   width 90",
     "width": 680,
     "height": 460
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "ws_bars_note",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     1620,
     0
    ],
    "code": null,
    "label": null,
    "params": {
     "text": "**Bars.** `Units bar blue` — ordinary. `Change` has negatives, so its bar grows from the middle either way. `Margin bar purple only` draws the bar instead of the number. In a live table every track ends level at the cell's right edge.",
     "width": 520,
     "height": 140
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "ws_marks",
    "type": "flograph.viz.show_table",
    "pos": [
     700,
     620
    ],
    "code": null,
    "label": "Marks",
    "params": {
     "format_rules": "Revenue  format $,.0f\nChange   format +.0%\nChange < 0 => fg red, icon ▼ red right\nChange > 0 => fg green, icon ▲ green right\nStatus   iconmap Status: ok=● green, risk=● amber, behind=● red",
     "width": 680,
     "height": 460
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "ws_marks_note",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
